{
  "name": "Sync Shopify orders to a rate-limited ERP with signature checks and Slack failure alerts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sync Shopify orders to a rate-limited ERP with signature checks and Slack failure alerts\n\n### Who's it for\nShopify stores whose ERP or order-management API has a rate limit. A flash sale fires one `orders/create` webhook per order, and calling the ERP directly turns that burst into 429 errors and missing orders.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Shopify order created** receives each order. **Compute signature** and **Signature matches?** check Shopify's HMAC header and answer 401 to anything unsigned.\n2. **Map order to ERP format** keeps what an ERP import needs: order number, customer, ship-to, totals and one line per SKU.\n3. **Queue order for the ERP** hands it to [Jitterflow](https://jitterflow.io), which delivers orders to the ERP one at a time at the endpoint's cadence, with retries. The Shopify order ID is the idempotency key, so Shopify's retries never import an order twice.\n4. **Acknowledge Shopify** answers 200 only after the order is queued.\n5. Every morning, the bottom lane reads Jitterflow's dead-letter queue (DLQ) and posts one Slack summary of orders the ERP rejected. No failures, no message.\n\n### Requirements\n- A Jitterflow account and API key. The free Developer plan works.\n- The `n8n-nodes-jitterflow` community node. It is verified by n8n, so it's available on n8n Cloud; on self-hosted n8n, install it from **Settings → Community Nodes**.\n- Shopify admin access and a Slack workspace.\n\n### How to set up\n1. In Jitterflow, add an endpoint whose destination URL is your ERP's order-import API. Set **Deliver one every** to the ERP's limit and put its API key in **Auth header**.\n2. Create a **Jitterflow API** credential, select it on both Jitterflow nodes, and paste the endpoint key into **Endpoint Key**.\n3. Create a **Crypto** credential whose **Hmac Secret** is your Shopify webhook signing secret, and select it on **Compute signature**.\n4. Select a Slack credential and channel on **Alert the ops channel**.\n5. Activate the workflow and add its production URL in Shopify as an `orders/create` webhook in JSON format.\n\n### How to customize\n- Change the fields in **Map order to ERP format** to match your ERP's import schema.\n- Send the alert to email or Microsoft Teams instead of Slack.",
        "height": 1100,
        "width": 600
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0101-4000-8000-000000000101",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Verify it came from Shopify\n**Raw Body** is on, so the signature is computed over the exact bytes Shopify signed. A request whose HMAC doesn't match gets a 401 and never reaches the ERP.",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0102-4000-8000-000000000102",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Map, queue, then acknowledge\nJitterflow accepts the order instantly, keyed `shopify-order-<id>`. Shopify gets its 200 only after that, so if the hand-off fails, Shopify retries it.\n\nTo pace each store separately, set **Target Identifier** to `{{ $json.shop }}`.",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0103-4000-8000-000000000103",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Each morning, find orders the ERP rejected\nAfter its last retry, Jitterflow moves an order to the DLQ. Only entries whose payload has `source: shopify` are kept, so other endpoints don't show up here.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0104-4000-8000-000000000104",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Post one Slack summary\nAll failed orders go into one message with the ERP's status code. Fix the cause, then replay them from the Jitterflow dashboard (replay needs the Pro plan).",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0105-4000-8000-000000000105",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "shopify-order-created",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": true
        }
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Shopify order created",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        320,
        260
      ],
      "webhookId": "d4d4d4d4-00ff-4000-8000-0000000000ff"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "action": "hmac",
        "binaryData": true,
        "type": "SHA256",
        "dataPropertyName": "computedHmac",
        "encoding": "base64"
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Compute signature",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.crypto",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        260
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "crypto": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Shopify webhook secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0201-4000-8000-000000000201",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.computedHmac }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $json.headers['x-shopify-hmac-sha256'] }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Signature matches?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "noData",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 401
        }
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Reject unsigned request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        900,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0301-4000-8000-000000000301",
              "name": "source",
              "value": "shopify",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0302-4000-8000-000000000302",
              "name": "externalOrderId",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.id }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0303-4000-8000-000000000303",
              "name": "orderNumber",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0304-4000-8000-000000000304",
              "name": "shop",
              "value": "={{ $json.headers['x-shopify-shop-domain'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0305-4000-8000-000000000305",
              "name": "placedAt",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.created_at }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0306-4000-8000-000000000306",
              "name": "currency",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.currency }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0307-4000-8000-000000000307",
              "name": "total",
              "value": "={{ Number($json.body.total_price) }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0308-4000-8000-000000000308",
              "name": "customer",
              "value": "={{ { email: $json.body.email, name: [$json.body.customer?.first_name, $json.body.customer?.last_name].filter(Boolean).join(' ') } }}",
              "type": "object"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0309-4000-8000-000000000309",
              "name": "shipTo",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.shipping_address ? { name: $json.body.shipping_address.name, address1: $json.body.shipping_address.address1, address2: $json.body.shipping_address.address2, city: $json.body.shipping_address.city, region: $json.body.shipping_address.province_code, postalCode: $json.body.shipping_address.zip, country: $json.body.shipping_address.country_code } : {} }}",
              "type": "object"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-030a-4000-8000-00000000030a",
              "name": "lines",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.line_items.map(line => ({ sku: line.sku, title: line.title, quantity: line.quantity, unitPrice: Number(line.price) })) }}",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Map order to ERP format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1100,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "webhook",
        "operation": "send",
        "endpointKey": "YOUR_JITTERFLOW_ENDPOINT_KEY",
        "idempotencyKey": "=shopify-order-{{ $json.externalOrderId }}",
        "payload": "={{ $json }}"
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Queue order for the ERP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-jitterflow.jitterflow",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        260
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "jitterflowApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Jitterflow API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "noData",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Acknowledge Shopify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1540,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0008-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Every morning at 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        880
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "dlq",
        "operation": "list",
        "resolvedFilter": "unresolved"
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-0009-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "List undelivered jobs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-jitterflow.jitterflow",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        880
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "jitterflowApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Jitterflow API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d4d4d4d4-0202-4000-8000-000000000202",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.lastPayload.source }}",
              "rightValue": "shopify",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-000a-4000-8000-00000000000a",
      "name": "Keep Shopify orders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        880
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData",
        "destinationFieldName": "failedOrders",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-000b-4000-8000-00000000000b",
      "name": "Collect into one list",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        880
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "orders-ops",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.failedOrders.length }} Shopify order{{ $json.failedOrders.length === 1 ? '' : 's' }} didn't reach the ERP:\n{{ $json.failedOrders.map(o => '• ' + o.lastPayload.orderNumber + ' (' + (o.responseStatus ? 'HTTP ' + o.responseStatus : o.failedReason) + ')').join('\\n') }}\nFix the cause, then replay them from the Jitterflow DLQ.",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "id": "d4d4d4d4-000c-4000-8000-00000000000c",
      "name": "Alert the ops channel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        1320,
        880
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
